  "critical_warning": "Momentum 78.1% accuracy is ARTIFACT of overlapping rolling windows (4/5 days shared between signal and target). NOT genuine prediction. HAR Logistic 67.9% is the best GENUINE directional predictor.",
  "key_findings": [
    "HAR Logistic achieves 67.9% directional accuracy (OOS 2023-2024, z=8.03, p<0.0001) — significantly above random",
    "Random Forest: 63.9% accuracy (z=6.25, p<0.0001) — also significantly above random",
    "Momentum 78.1% is ARTIFACT: RV_5d(t-1) vs RV_5d(t-6) shares 4/5 days with target RV_5d(t) vs RV_5d(t-5) — overlapping window, not real prediction",
    "VIX-only direction: 49.6% — pure random. VIX level does NOT predict vol direction (confirms K697)",
    "HAR Logistic and RF significantly beat naive (McNemar p<0.0001)",
    "HOWEVER: direction-timing strategies ALL underperform Buy & Hold (HAR 32.7% vs BH 57.6%)",
    "Key coefficient: log_RV_5d positive (+1.51), log_RV_22d negative (-1.66) — weekly vol above monthly average predicts further increase",
    "Direction prediction is statistically accurate but economically useless for simple timing",
    "Best accuracy in extreme quintiles: Q1(big drop) 71.3%, Q5(big rise) 85.1% — easier at extremes",
    "VIX sufficiency test #26: VIX alone is INSUFFICIENT for direction prediction (49.6% = random)"
